    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi></mi><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>&#945;</mi><mi></mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mi></mi><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8721;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8721;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#947;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#947;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8721;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#947;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p>"
